t the pad represents distinctly lower hypertrophic quality than dynamic trunk loading.", "normalized_etu": 0.0294, "contraction_mode": ["isometric"], "high_tension_rom": "brief", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 81.71, "smh_interpretation": "The trunk remains externally supported and the obliques perform only low-level positional bracing.", "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 3.00, "resistance_profile_alignment": "poor", "duration_of_meaningful_tension": "moderate", "muscle_length_under_high_tension": "mixed"}, {"H_m": 0.8000, "muscle": "transverse_abdominis", "etu_cm2": 2.00, "rationale": "The exposure is low-ROM and primarily postural, warranting the lower calibration anchor.", "normalized_etu": 0.0910, "contraction_mode": ["isometric"], "high_tension_rom": "brief", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 21.97, "smh_interpretation": "The muscle provides circumferential bracing without meaningful excursion while the back pad supplies most external trunk support.", "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 2.50, "resistance_profile_alignment": "poor", "duration_of_meaningful_tension": "moderate", "muscle_length_under_high_tension": "mixed"}, {"H_m": 0.8500, "muscle": "tibialis_anterior", "etu_cm2": 1.70, "rationale": "Mechanically meaningful ankle control remains predominantly stabilizing and limited in productive ROM.", "normalized_etu": 0.0408, "contraction_mode": ["isometric", "eccentric"], "high_tension_rom": "limited", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 41.70, "smh_interpretation": "The muscle controls foot and ankle position but does not perform broad loaded dorsiflexion through the repetition.", "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 2.00, "resistance_profile_alignment": "moderate", "duration_of_meaningful_tension": "moderate", "muscle_length_under_high_tension": "mixed"}, {"H_m": 0.8500, "muscle": "gluteus_minimus", "etu_cm2": 1.28, "rationale": "The tension is specific and meaningful but predominantly isometric and accessory.", "normalized_etu": 0.0516, "contraction_mode": ["isometric"], "high_tension_rom": "brief", "maximum_f