ing baseline reflects additional control near the deepest position without treating stabilization as a separate additive force.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 170.80, "mechanical_roles": ["joint_stabilization", "load_transmission", "eccentric_control"], "tension_fraction": 0.0732, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 11.15, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractile", "dynamic_eccentric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 12.50, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_stabilizing_or_load_transmitting"}, {"muscle": "pectoralis_major_sternal", "rationale": "Assists horizontal adduction and shoulder control during the press component and eccentrically controls reopening of the upper arm. The supplied value plausibly captures its complete dynamic tension.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 53.48, "mechanical_roles": ["propulsive", "eccentric_control"], "tension_fraction": 0.2277, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 12.18, "contraction_character": ["dynamic_concentric", "dynamic_eccentric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 12.18, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_propulsive"}, {"muscle": "serratus_anterior", "rationale": "Maintains the scapula against the bench and controls limited protraction as force transfers through the shoulder girdle. A modest increase reflects scapular control not fully represented by the supplied movement baseline.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 36.03, "mechanical_roles": ["scapular_control", "load_transmission", "eccentric_control"], "tension_fraction": 0.1804, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 5.62, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "dynamic_concentric", "dynamic_eccentric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 6.50, "input_contribution_classification": "mixed_propulsive_and_stabilizing"}, {"muscle": "pectoralis_major_clavicular", "rationale": "Assists shoulder flexion and adduction as the bar returns toward the pressing position. The supplied value represents its meaningful dynamic contribution and requires no additional allocation.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 13.52, "mechanical_roles":