ed unchanged.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 39.81, "mechanical_roles": ["propulsive", "eccentric_control", "multi_joint_control"], "tension_fraction": 0.2831, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 11.27, "contraction_character": ["dynamic_concentric", "dynamic_eccentric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 11.27, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_propulsive"}, {"muscle": "brachioradialis", "rationale": "The neutral forearm position strongly aligns with brachioradialis elbow-flexion function while the preacher support limits compensatory shoulder movement. The supplied contribution already captures its complete dynamic exposure.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 11.22, "mechanical_roles": ["propulsive", "eccentric_control", "limb_position_maintenance"], "tension_fraction": 0.6729, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 7.55, "contraction_character": ["dynamic_concentric", "dynamic_eccentric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 7.55, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_propulsive"}, {"muscle": "pronators_supinators", "rationale": "Maintains the neutral forearm orientation against the dumbbell's rotational tendency. The supplied value is interpreted as the complete forearm-orientation demand rather than dynamic pronation or supination.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 60.88, "mechanical_roles": ["limb_position_maintenance", "grip_maintenance", "isometric_fixation"], "tension_fraction": 0.0470, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 2.86, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractile"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 2.86, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_stabilizing_or_load_transmitting"}, {"muscle": "wrist_flexors", "rationale": "Maintains the dumbbell grip and transmits elbow-flexion force through the hand while resisting unwanted wrist extension.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 54.40, "mechanical_roles": ["grip_maintenance", "isometric_fixation", "load_transmission"], "tension_fraction": 0.0276, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 0.00, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractile"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2