le centres the humeral head against the cable's posterior and translational forces. A modest increment reflects additional joint-centring tension beyond the supplied external-rotation baseline.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 170.80, "mechanical_roles": ["propulsive", "joint_stabilization", "eccentric_control", "load_transmission"], "tension_fraction": 0.0615, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 9.09, "contraction_character": ["dynamic_concentric", "dynamic_eccentric", "co_contractile"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 10.50, "input_contribution_classification": "mixed_propulsive_and_stabilizing"}, {"muscle": "trapezius_middle", "rationale": "Retracts the scapulae during the pull and controls protraction during the return while maintaining medial scapular stability. A small increment represents continuous fixation not fully captured by the supplied retraction contribution.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 26.18, "mechanical_roles": ["propulsive", "scapular_control", "eccentric_control"], "tension_fraction": 0.3438, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 8.31, "contraction_character": ["dynamic_concentric", "dynamic_eccentric", "isometric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 9.00, "input_contribution_classification": "mixed_propulsive_and_stabilizing"}, {"muscle": "rhomboids", "rationale": "Contributes to scapular retraction and medial-border control while eccentrically regulating protraction. A limited increment reflects stabilization accompanying the dynamic retraction force.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 28.25, "mechanical_roles": ["propulsive", "scapular_control", "eccentric_control"], "tension_fraction": 0.2549, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 6.61, "contraction_character": ["dynamic_concentric", "dynamic_eccentric", "isometric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 7.20, "input_contribution_classification": "mixed_propulsive_and_stabilizing"}, {"muscle": "brachialis", "rationale": "Assists elbow flexion as the rope approaches the face and helps maintain the intended elbow angle relative to the cable. The supplied value already represents this mixed dynamic and positional demand.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 44.05, "mechanical_roles": ["propulsive", "limb_position_maintenance", "eccentric_control"], "tension_fraction": 0.0876, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 3.86, "contraction_character": ["dynamic_concentric", "dynamic_eccentric", "isometric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 3.86, "input_contribution_classification": "mixed_propulsive_and_stabilizing"}, {"muscle": "trapezius_lower", "rationale": "Controls posterior tilt, scapular depression, and upward-rotation balance while the scapula retracts. A small increment reflects continuous scapular fixation accompanying its dynamic role.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 14.98, "mechanical_roles": ["scapular_control", "load_transmission", "eccentric_control"], "tension_fraction": 0.2336, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 3.13, "contraction_character": ["dynamic_concentric", "dynamic_eccentric", "isometric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 3.50, "input_contribution_classification": "mixed_propulsive_and_stabilizing"}, {"muscle": "biceps_brachii", "rationale": "Provides a minor elbow-flexion contribution and assists anterior shoulder stability while spanning both joints. The supplied value is retained as the complete low-level mixed force state.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 39.81, "mechanical_roles": ["propulsive", "joint_stabilization", "multi_joint_control"], "tension_fraction": 0.0638, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 2.54, "contraction_character": ["dynamic_concentric", "dynamic_eccentric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 2.54, "input_contribution_classification": "mixed_propulsive_and_stabilizing"}, {"muscle": "wrist_flexors", "rationale": "Maintains the rope grip and prevents the handles from opening under cable tension. The low allocation reflects a secure but nonlimiting gripping demand.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 54.40, "mechanical_roles": ["grip_maintenance", "isometric_fixation", "load_transmission"], "tension_fraction": 0.0368, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 0.00, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_con