ompanying the supplied dynamic contribution.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 36.03, "mechanical_roles": ["scapular_control", "load_transmission", "eccentric_control"], "tension_fraction": 0.2220, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 7.36, "contraction_character": ["dynamic_concentric", "dynamic_eccentric", "isometric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 8.00, "input_contribution_classification": "mixed_propulsive_and_stabilizing"}, {"muscle": "deltoid_lateral", "rationale": "Assists humeral elevation and frontal-plane stabilization during the inclined press. The supplied value already captures its secondary dynamic and stabilizing force state.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 45.73, "mechanical_roles": ["propulsive", "joint_stabilization", "eccentric_control"], "tension_fraction": 0.1286, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 5.88, "contraction_character": ["dynamic_concentric", "dynamic_eccentric"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 5.88, "input_contribution_classification": "mixed_propulsive_and_stabilizing"}, {"muscle": "wrist_flexors", "rationale": "Maintains the bar grip and transmits pressing force through the hands while resisting wrist extension.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 54.40, "mechanical_roles": ["grip_maintenance", "isometric_fixation", "load_transmission"], "tension_fraction": 0.0368, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 0.00, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractile"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 2.00, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_stabilizing_or_load_transmitting"}, {"muscle": "pectoralis_minor", "rationale": "Provides minor anterior scapular fixation and load transmission against the bench. A small increment reflects continuous stabilization without overstating its contribution.", "maximum_fcsa_cm2": 10.81, "mechanical_roles": ["scapular_control", "load_transmission", "isometric_fixation"], "tension_fraction": 0.1388, "propulsive_fcsa_cm2": 1.12, "contraction_character": ["isometric", "co_contractile"], "active_tension_exposure_cm2": 1.50, "input_contribution_classification": "primarily_s